\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Definition}
\title{Context-window sampler}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{pretraining}

\p{Fix the context length #{T} from \ref{ftip-0015}. A
\newvocab{context-window sampler} draws cleaned text from the law described in
\ref{ftip-0018} and tokenizes it with \ref{ftip-000E}. It then chooses a
declared offset and returns a length-#{T} token sequence #{x_{1:T}} together
with metadata that identifies document boundaries.}

\p{If fewer than #{T} tokens remain, the sampler must specify whether it pads,
drops the suffix, or joins another document. These choices change both the
distribution of contexts and the prediction mask.}
